# rrubocop

Rust RuboCop drop-in for Ruby (tree-sitter). No Ruby for linting; ERB configs need ruby/bundle.

## Layout
- `src/cli.rs` — RuboCop-compatible CLI
- `src/baseline.rs` + `src/resources/baseline.json` — RuboCop/gem versions for `--help`/`--version`
- `src/config/` — RuboCop-parity YAML (`mod.rs` re-exports; `gem_path`, `yaml_read` ERB, `types`, `globutil`, `filter`/`filter_match`/`filter_path`, `discover`, `standard`/`standard_convert`, `merge`/`merge_cop`, `parse`/`parse_{allcops,cop}`, `load`/`load_{defaults,require,gems,recursive,lockfile,resolve}`, `ruby_ver`, `resolved`/`resolved_{state,enabled,inject,cop_cfg,filters,effective,fingerprint}`)
- `src/cache/` — abcop-style redb result cache (`RRUBOCOP_CACHE_DIR` / XDG)
- `src/cop/` — cops by department (`bundler`, `factory_bot`, `gemspec`(+ordered_dependencies_group), `graphql`(+helpers/{args,kwargs,description,names_field,klass,names}; 26 cops), `layout` (90 Layout cops), `lint` (65 + UselessAssignment), `metrics`, `naming`, `performance`, `rails`, `rake`, `rspec`, `rspec_rails`, `security`, `style` (143 Style cops + `heuristics/` + `trailing_comma_args`), `shared`, `walker`, `registry`)
- `src/parse/` — SourceFile, CodeMap, directives, tree-sitter parse
- `src/linter/` — parallel lint + cache (`mod.rs`, `parallel.rs`) and per-file phases (`engine/` + `syntax_gate`)
- `src/formatter/` — text/json/progress (live marks)/…
- `src/abc/`, `src/model/` — Metrics/AbcSize (tree-sitter)
- `vendor/tree-sitter-ruby/` — grammar
- `testdata/cross_test_nitrocop.py` — offense compare vs local nitrocop
- `tests/fixtures/cops/` — nitrocop-style `offense.rb` / `no_offense.rb` per cop (`src/testutil/` + `cop_fixture_tests!`); when fixing FPs/parity, always add fixtures (see `.cursor/rules/cop-parity-tests.mdc`)
- Reference clones (outside repo): `/home/crexus/nitrocop`, `/home/crexus/rubocop`, `/home/crexus/abcop`
